name texinfo
category Package
revision 76658
shortdesc Texinfo documentation system
longdesc Texinfo is the preferred format for documentation in the GNU
longdesc project; the format may be used to produce online or printed
longdesc output from a single source. The Texinfo macros may be used to
longdesc produce printable output using TeX; other programs in the
longdesc distribution offer online interactive use (with hypertext
longdesc linkages in some cases). The latest release of the texinfo.tex
longdesc macros and texi2dvi and texi2pdf scripts may be found in the
longdesc texinfo-latest package, which are usually newer than the last
longdesc full release. CTAN does not hold any other Texinfo-related
longdesc files; see its GNU home page for downloads and other info.
